---Those are the top level/root-level properties for the k8s yaml files

  - 'apiVersion:' It is the version of the k8s api being used to create the project
  - 'kind:' This refers to the type of object that you are trying to create
  - 'metadata:' This is data about the object like name, labels, etc
  - 'spec:' This is where the pod specs are setup
---Kind && Version
 - Kind: Pod          Version: v1
 - Kind: Service      Version: v1
